  14:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** *   @brief   This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** *            of the Temperature Sensor component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** *
  17:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** *   @details This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** *            of the Temperature Sensor component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  19:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** *
  20:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****  */
  21:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** 
