  26:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** /** @addtogroup STELLAR_PMSM_MC_FOC_LIBRARY
  27:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * @{
  28:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   */
  29:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** 
  30:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** /** @defgroup TemperatureSensor NTC Temperature Sensor
  31:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * @brief Allows to read the temperature of the heat sink
  32:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *
  33:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * This component implements both a virtual and a real temperature sensor,
  34:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * depending on the sensor availability.
  35:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *
  36:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * Access to the MCU peripherals needed to acquire the temperature (GPIO and ADC
  37:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * used for regular conversion) is managed by the PWM component used in the Motor
  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * Control subsystem. As a consequence, this NTC temperature sensor implementation
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * is hardware-independent.
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * If a real temperature sensor is available (Sensor Type = #REAL_SENSOR),
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * this component can handle NTC sensors or, more generally, analog temperature sensors
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * which output is related to the temperature by the following formula:
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * @f[
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *               V_{out} = V_0 + \frac{dV}{dT} \cdot ( T - T_0)
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * @f]
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *
  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * In case a real temperature sensor is not available (Sensor Type = #VIRTUAL_SENSOR),
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * This component will always returns a constant, programmable, temperature.
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   *
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   * @{
  53:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c ****   */
  54:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/ntc_temperature_sensor.c **** 
